  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maced.- Albanian dialogue</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Makedonskalbansk dialog</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;mnar skapa en dialog mellan albanska och makedonska journalister i Makedonien genom gemensamma aktiviteter och utbildning. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r, att minska hatrapporteringen i makedonska medier och h&#xF6;ja den journalistiska standarden i Makedonien f&#xF6;r att d&#xE4;rigenom minska de etniska sp&#xE4;nningarna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims att creating a dialogue between Albanian and Macedonian journalists in Macedonia through joint activities and training. The aim is to reduce hate speech in the reporting of Mac. media and to raise the journalistic standards in Mac. in order to reduce ethnic tensions.</narrative>
  </description>
